Package: predictTTE
Type: Package
Title: Predict Time-To-Event Milestones from Interim ADTTE Data
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      given = "Yuquan",
      family = "Wang",
      role = c("aut", "cre"),
      email = "richanwang@proton.me"
    )
  )
Description: Simulates enrollment, event, and dropout trajectories from
    interim ADTTE data to predict milestone event dates and event counts
    at user-specified dates, including confidence intervals and an
    interactive cumulative event plot.
